ring footprint, we delivered ahead of schedule on our plans to streamline our back-end operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/allegro-microsystems-inc-algm-q4-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"ALGM 2021 Q4","e":"algm","d":"2021-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Walsh","x":"That benefits all of our businesses because it's a process cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/allegro-microsystems-inc-algm-q4-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"ALGM 2022 Q1","e":"algm","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Walsh","x":"Stock compensation expense was $4.3 million for R&D and SG&A. Other non-GAAP adjustments were $1.2 million related to the closure of our Thai entity, COVID-19, contingent consideration adjustments and severance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/allegro-microsystems-inc-algm-q1-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"ALGM 2022 Q2","e":"algm","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Walsh","x":"We've been successful in maintaining considerable pricing power of our products helping to offset rising input costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/allegro-microsystems-inc-algm-q2-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"ALGM 2022 Q2","e":"algm","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Walsh","x":"And what we've been able to do is to offset that with price increases where it makes sense strategically.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/allegro-microsystems-inc-algm-q2-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"ALGM 2022 Q3","e":"algm","d":"2022-02-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ravi Vig","x":"I think what you'll find is that we have a long-term relationship with strategic customers and our approach on pricing has been that we would certainly pass through, being margin neutral on ASP.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/01/allegro-microsystems-inc-algm-q3-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"ALGM 2022 Q4","e":"algm","d":"2022-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Derek D'Antilio","x":"We will continue to look at strategic price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/10/allegro-microsystems-inc-algm-q4-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"ALGM 2022 Q4","e":"algm","d":"2022-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Srini Pajjuri","x":"And then in terms of the gross margins, Derek, so you talked about the time lag between the price increases and the cost increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/10/allegro-microsystems-inc-algm-q4-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"ALGM 2023 Q1","e":"algm","d":"2022-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Derek DAntilio","x":"We have been successful in maintaining our gross margins and improving our operating margins with the sales mix toward more feature-rich products, expanding our supply chain, implementing select price increases and effectively leveraging our fixed cost structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/28/allegro-microsystems-inc-algm-q1-2023-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"ALGM 2023 Q1","e":"algm","d":"2022-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Derek DAntilio","x":"We had wage price increases in Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/28/allegro-microsystems-inc-algm-q1-2023-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"ALGM 2023 Q1","e":"algm","d":"2022-07-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Derek DAntilio","x":"The incremental supply is reflected in us increasing our annual outlook from high teens to 20%, but we're not quite there yet, not even near there yet in terms of having supply equal demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/28/allegro-microsystems-inc-algm-q1-2023-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"ALGM 2026 Q4","e":"algm","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Derek D'Antilio","x":"And I might ge